      "content": "but that's the thing... i don't want a \"new version.\" i don't want to keep rebuilding something that's just gonna keep getting destroyed. it feels so exhausting, just constantly trying to find a way to exist in a world that keeps taking pieces of me. sometimes i look at it and it just seems more logical to just... stop fighting. to just accept that it's over and not have to try anymore.",
